cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Western Blot Band Analysis"
abstract: >-
  Desktop application for quantifying Western blot bands: semi-automatic
  band detection, local background correction (profile baseline,
  above/below strips or ring), lane-by-lane normalisation of a target
  protein to a loading control, and auditable exports (results CSV,
  intensity profiles, annotated images, per-image ROI files and an
  activity log).
type: software
